{"id":"00577","root":"uni00577_1","name":{"ja":"エルヴィーラ","en":"Elvira"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"エルヴィーラ","en":"Elvira"},"element":"Devilish","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2022-04-15","limited":false,"characterId":336,"profile":{"ja":"全身鎧に身を包んだ死霊騎士＜レヴァナント＞。死者に一時的に生命を与え操る力を持つレイスと呼ばれる高位魔族で、“屍の王”レイスロードに仕える騎士。無口で無表情、抑揚なくぶつぶつと喋る。生前は誇り高き魔界騎士であったが、味方の謀略によって非業の死を遂げ打ち捨てられていたところを、屍の王の手によって蘇らせられ、その忠実なしもべとなった。死霊騎士＜レヴァナント＞は通常その力の具現化としてゴーレムを従えているが、彼女はゴーレムを鎧として身に纏い、その中に瘴気を閉じ込めることで自らの動作能力と防御力を高めている。瘴気を漂わせながら大鎌を振う鎧姿はまさに死神。なお、寡黙な性格は生前からのものであるらしい。","en":"She is a death knight, a Revanant, clad in full armor, with the power to temporarily grant life to the dead and control them, known as a high-ranking demon, a Rais, serving the Lord of the Dead, the Rais Lord. She is taciturn and expressionless, speaking in a monotone voice. In her past life, she was a proud knight of the Demon Realm, but was betrayed by her allies and left to die, only to be revived by the Lord of the Dead and become his loyal servant. As a death knight, she typically wields a golem, but instead, she wears the golem as armor, sealing the miasma within to enhance her mobility and defensive capabilities. Her armored form, wielding a large scythe and radiating miasma, is a true embodiment of death. Her taciturn nature, it seems, dates back to her past life."},"illustrator":"カガミ","voiceActor":"黒森オシカ","forms":[{"id":"uni00577_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[812,1624],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[148,296],"def":[86,172],"spd":[65,65],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","1430009"]},{"id":"uni00577_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1224,2448],"sp":[280,280],"atk":[246,492],"def":[122,244],"spd":[65,65],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","1430009","1430010"]},{"id":"uni00577_3","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1636,3274],"sp":[340,340],"atk":[344,689],"def":[158,317],"spd":[65,65],"luck":[1,80]},